# ttt opening the file Ferret just edited, at the same line. Rendered by record.sh with vhs.
Output build/demo/ttt.mp4
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1600
Set Height 1000
Set Theme "GruvboxDark"
Set Padding 20
Set Framerate 30

Hide
Type "cd ~/ferret-demo/tidepool && clear" Enter
Type "ttt ~/ferret-demo/tidepool ~/ferret-demo/tidepool/internal/queue/worker.go:14:19" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Up
Sleep 400ms
Up
Sleep 1.5s
